// The Apple Developer team the archive is signed with: Mohamed's individual team, and never
// LOOPDL LIMITED (5S5P2Q72MV), which is his employer's and must not publish Taqwa. Left empty
// until his Team ID is known — a device archive then fails loudly instead of registering the
// identifiers under the wrong team. Simulator builds need no team.
TEAM_ID=
// world.taqwa.app, the Android package, is registered to LOOPDL's team on Apple's side (Xcode did
// that with automatic signing before the accounts were settled), and Apple identifiers are unique
// across every team — so the App Store identity is world.taqwa.ios (docs/STORE-CHECKLIST.md §1).
BUNDLE_ID=world.taqwa.ios
APP_NAME=Taqwa
